		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_013"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>セッカシティ　ね……▼
しきの　うつろい　というか
ふゆげしきが　すきな　まちね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:27:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>セッカシティ　ね……▼
四季の　移ろい　というか
冬景色が　好きな　街ね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:36:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>セッカシティ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
