			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>４番道路</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_019"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>５ばんどうろの
パフォーマーを　みるため▼
ポケモンセンターを
ぬけだしたわね……▼
ついでに　どうぐを　かいとってくれる
おんなのこと　あったりしてたわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:16:31" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>５番道路の
パフォーマーを　みるため▼
ポケモンセンターを
抜け出したわね……▼
ついでに　道具を　買い取ってくれる
女の子と　会ったりしてたわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:16:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>５番道路</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_020"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>６ばんどうろの
きせつけんきゅうじょに　いった？▽
それに　どうくつも　あったっけ？▼
あとは……
そうね　たまげるかもね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:28:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>６番道路の
季節研究所に　行った？▽
それに　洞穴も　あったっけ？▼
あとは……
そうね　たまげるかもね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T05:38:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>６番道路</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_021"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>７ばんどうろの　いっぽんばし！
うっかり　とまると　おちちゃうのよね！▼
あとは　ながい　くさむらから
いがいな　ポケモンが　とびだしたっけ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:28:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>７番道路の　一本橋！
うっかり　止まると　落ちちゃうのよね！▼
あとは　長い　草むらから
意外な　ポケモンが　飛び出したっけ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T05:39:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>７番道路</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_022"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>８ばんどうろの　みずたまり
ふゆに　なると　こおって▽
すべって　うまく　すすめないのが▽
ママの　おきにいり　ね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:28:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>８番道路の　水たまり
冬に　なると　こおって▽
滑って　うまく　進めないのが▽
ママの　お気に入り　ね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T05:41:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
