	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_042"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>カゴメタウン　かあ▼
いったときの　いんしょうだと
ひると　よるとで▽
ぜんぜん　ちがう　まち　だったわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:28:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>カゴメタウン　かあ▼
行ったときの　印象だと
昼と　夜とで▽
全然　違う　町だったわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:19:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>カゴメタウン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_043"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サザナミタウンね▼
むかしは　すっごい
おかねもちが　いたんだけど▽
ひっこし　なさったらしいわね▼
でも　マリンチューブが
すごいって　ウワサを　きいたわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:20:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サザナミタウンね▼
昔は　すっごい
お金持ちが　いたんだけど▽
引越し　なさったらしいわね▼
でも　マリンチューブが
すごいって　ウワサを　きいたわ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:20:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>サザナミタウン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:47" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
