		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_073"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まよいのもり……▼
ママ　おもうんだけど
ポケモンの　しわざ　なのかもね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:31:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>迷いの森……▼
ママ　思うんだけど
ポケモンの　仕業　なのかもね？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:31:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>迷いの森
※swanではゾロアークイベント後のマップ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:57:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment />
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:31:15" />
		</CommentCell>
