	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_080"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>セッカシティ　ね……▼
しきの　うつろい　というか
ふゆげしきが　すきな　まちね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:31:41" />
