	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_087"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっと　こえが　とおいけど……▼
ネジやま？▼
なっとく！　ヤーコンさんの
やま　なのよねー▼
カセキが　みつかる　ばしょって
ママは　きいてるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:31:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ちょっと　声が　遠いけど……▼
ネジ山？▼
納得！　ヤーコンさんの
山なのよねー▼
カセキが　みつかる　場所って
ママは　聞いてるわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:42:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ネジ山
※重複</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T13:23:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:56" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_088"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>リュウラセンのとう！
へー　なかに　はいれるんだ？▼
あれでしょ？　でんせつの　ポケモンが
ねむっているかも　しれない　ばしょね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:31:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>リュウラセンの塔！
へー　中に　はいれるんだ？▼
あれでしょ？　伝説の　ポケモンが
眠っているかも　しれない　場所ね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:42:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>リュウラセンの塔
※重複</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T13:48:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_089"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジャイアントホール？▼
どこだっけ……？
いんせきが　おちた　ばしょ？▼
あれ　ちがったっけ？▼
アララギはかせに　そんな
はなしを　きいた　きがするけど……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:32:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ジャイアントホール？▼
どこだっけ……？
いんせきが　落ちた　場所？▼
あれ　違ったっけ？▼
アララギ博士に　そんな
話を　聞いた　気がするけど……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T06:43:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ジャイアントホール
※重複</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T13:49:02" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:12:56" />
