		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_123"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サンギタウンねー
アデクさんの　いえには　いった？▼
むかしは　ママも
アデクさんに　ポケモンを▽
おしえてもらったわ！　なつかしい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:33:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サンギタウンねー
アデクさんの　家には　行った？▼
昔は　ママも
アデクさんに　ポケモンを▽
教えてもらったわ！　懐かしい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T08:05:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>サンギタウン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_124"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤマジタウンは
リバースマウンテン　ちかくの▽
ちいさな　まち　だけど▼
かわった　まちなみで
いがいと　にんきの　ばしょよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:26:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤマジタウンは
リバースマウンテン　近くの▽
小さな　町だけど▼
変わった　町並みで
意外と　人気の　場所よ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T06:26:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ヤマジタウン</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_125"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>１９ばんどうろは
ヒオウギを　でて　すぐの　ばしょ▼
やまあいの　みち　といった　かんじの
どうろ　でしょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:35:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>１９番道路は
ヒオウギを　出て　すぐの　場所▼
山あいの　道　といった　感じの
道路　でしょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:00:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>１９ばんどうろ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_126"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２０ばんどうろも
きせつの　へんかを　たのしめるわ▼
ママが　すきなのは　あき！
だって　おちばが……　ね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:33:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２０番道路も
季節の　変化を　楽しめるわ▼
ママが　好きなのは　秋！
だって　落ち葉が……　ね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:01:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>２０ばんどうろ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_127"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２１ばんすいどう　は
いわが　おおい！　って　かんじ▼
なので　いがいに　すすむのが
たいへんな　めいろ　みたいよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:31:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２１番水道　は
岩が　多い！　って　感じ▼
なので　意外に　進むのが
大変な　迷路　みたいよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:01:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>２１ばんすいどう</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_128"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２２ばんどうろ　は
みどりゆたかな　どうろ　ね▼
ということは　いろんな
ポケモンが　いるかもね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:29:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２２番道路　は
緑豊かな　道路　ね▼
ということは　いろんな
ポケモンが　いるかもね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:02:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>２２ばんどうろ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_129"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>２３ばんどうろ　ねえ……▼
イッシュに　のこる
さいごの　だいしぜん……▼
なんて　おおげさに　かたる　ひとが
いるほど　きふくに　とんだ▽
すすむのも　けわしい　みち　らしいね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:32:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>２３番道路　ねえ……▼
イッシュに　残る
最後の　大自然……▼
なんて　おおげさに　語る　人が
いるほど　起伏に　とんだ▽
進むのも　険しい　道らしいね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-14T03:07:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>２３ばんどうろ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
