			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>プラズマフリゲート</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:34:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_137"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こだいのぬけみち……▼
そのなのとおり
こだいに　つくられた　ちかつうろ▼
だれが　なんのために　つくったのか
とおりぬければ　わかるかもね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:36:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>古代の抜け道……▼
その名のとおり
古代に　作られた　地下通路▼
だれが　なんのために　作ったのか
通り抜ければ　わかるかもね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:13:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>古代の抜け道</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:34:21" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_138"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヤーコンロード　ね▼
なんでも　ヤーコンさんが
こつこつと　ほりすすんでいた　って▼
あなをほる　って
みりょくてき　なのかしら？▼
シンオウちほうにも　あなをほるのが
すきな　ひとが　いるって　きいたわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:39:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヤーコンロード　ね▼
なんでも　ヤーコンさんが
こつこつと　掘り進んでいた　って▼
穴を掘る　って
魅力的　なのかしら？▼
シンオウ地方にも　穴を掘るのが
好きな　人が　いるって　聞いたわ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:15:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ヤーコンロード</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:34:16" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
