	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_140"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しろのじゅどう！▼
いわゆる　イッシュのなんかん　ね
どこまで　いけるか？▼
そんなの　ポケモンと　いっしょの
あなたなら　よゆう　でしょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T10:10:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>白の樹洞！▼
いわゆる　イッシュの難関　ね
どこまで　行けるか？▼
そんなの　ポケモンと　一緒の
あなたなら　余裕でしょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T10:10:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>白の樹洞</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:34:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
