	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_141"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>くろのまてんろう！▼
いわゆる　イッシュのなんかん　ね
どこまで　いけるか？▼
そんなの　ポケモンと　いっしょの
あなたなら　よゆう　でしょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T10:10:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>黒の摩天楼！▼
いわゆる　イッシュの難関　ね
どこまで　行けるか？▼
そんなの　ポケモンと　一緒の
あなたなら　余裕でしょ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T10:10:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>黒の摩天楼</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:34:40" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_142"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うみべのどうくつ　ね……▼
おおきな　いわを　いつのまにか
なみや　かぜ……　そして　ポケモンが▽
あなを　あけた　どうくつ　なのよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:33:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>海辺の洞穴　ね……▼
大きな　岩を　いつの間にか
波や　風……　そして　ポケモンが▽
穴を　開けた　洞穴なのよね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T13:36:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>海辺の洞窟</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:41:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_143"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こころのくうどう　ね……▼
なにかが　いるだろう……
そういわれても　なにもいない▽
ふしぎな　ばしょ　らしいわね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:34:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>心の空洞　ね……▼
何かが　いるだろう……
そういわれても　何もいない▽
不思議な　場所　らしいわね▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:20:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>心の空洞</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:40:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_144"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かくしあな……？▼
ちょっと　わからないわね▼
ちなみに　ママは
なにも　かくしていないわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:34:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>隠し穴……？▼
ちょっと　わからないわね▼
ちなみに　ママは
何も　隠していないわよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
