	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_148"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しぜんほごく……？
ウワサには　きいたこと　あるけど▼
めずらしい　ポケモンを　まもるため
えらばれた　ひとしか▽
いけないように　してるって……▼
なあに？　あなた
えらばれちゃったのかしら！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:33:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>自然保護区……？
ウワサには　聞いたこと　あるけど▼
珍しい　ポケモンを　守るため
選ばれた　人しか▽
行けないように　してるって……▼
なあに？　あなた
選ばれちゃったのかしら！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:22:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>D35
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-07-19T02:54:09" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_149"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふふふ……▼
あなたも　とりつかれたのね
メダルの　みりょくに！▼
メダルじむきょく　なら
いろんなことが　わかるよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-13T02:33:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ふふふ……▼
あなたも　取り付かれたのね
メダルの　魅力に！▼
メダル事務局　なら
いろんなことが　わかるよね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-13T07:26:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>C03R1102</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:21:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-20T06:13:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_150"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なあに？
ちていいせき？▼
しらないわねえ▼
ママも　いって　どんな　ばしょか
みておいたほうが　いいかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-10T10:13:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なあに？
地底遺跡？▼
